The following little gripe is for the Mac version, but it might apply to other
computers with pull down menu's (I haven't seen any other versions):

When the cursor is moved normally over the map, it becomes that little arrow =>
indicating that a mouse click will move you in that direction. Often when I am
adventuring I spend many (valuable!) minutes going up to the Info menu to
select "Specify object by cursor" when finding about all the stuff and
monsters in a room. I NEVER move with the mouse (ok, flame away if you do). I
would much prefer the cursor to remain constantly on "Specify object by cursor".

However, to make everybody happy, maybe a good solution would be to have an
option: Toggle mouse between specify and move. This would be :-)

Maybe someone can think of some other preferred mouse actions/preferences?


